@startuml design-class-diagram
title 图 2-3 设计类图（实体类与关系）\n控制类、边界类见 表 2-1；交互细节见各用例序列图

skinparam {
  DefaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
  DefaultFontSize 11
  shadowing false
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  ClassBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ClassBorderColor #94A3B8
  linetype ortho
}
hide circle
hide empty members
top to bottom direction

package "entity 实体类（领域对象）" #EFF6FF {
  class "用户 User" as User {
    - id : Long
    - phone : String
    - passwordHash : String
    - name : String
    - role : Role
    - status : UserStatus
    + isActive() : boolean
    + hasRole(role) : boolean
  }
  class "医生 Doctor" as Doctor {
    - userId : Long
    - departmentId : Long
    - title : String
    - specialty : String
    - consultationFee : BigDecimal
    - onlineStatus : boolean
    + canAccept() : boolean
  }
  class "科室 Department" as Department {
    - id : Long
    - name : String
    - sortNo : Integer
  }
  class "问诊订单 ConsultationOrder" as Order {
    - id : Long
    - orderNo : String
    - patientId : Long
    - doctorId : Long
    - departmentId : Long
    - illnessDesc : String
    - status : OrderStatus
    - fee : BigDecimal
    - payTime : LocalDateTime
    - prescriptionReady : boolean
    - noPrescription : boolean
    - version : Integer
    + pay(now)
    + accept(now)
    + reject(reason, now)
    + markPrescriptionReady()
    + end(now)
  }
  class "会话消息 ConsultationMessage" as Message {
    - id : Long
    - orderId : Long
    - senderId : Long
    - senderRole : Role
    - messageType : MessageType
    - content : String
    - imageUrl : String
    - createdAt : LocalDateTime
  }
  class "处方 Prescription" as Prescription {
    - id : Long
    - prescriptionNo : String
    - orderId : Long
    - doctorId : Long
    - patientId : Long
    - diagnosis : String
    - status : PrescriptionStatus
    - rejectReason : String
    - validUntil : LocalDateTime
    - cancelReason : String
    - version : Integer
    + submit(now)
    + withdraw()
    + approve(reviewerId, now)
    + reject(reviewerId, reason, now)
    + resubmit(now)
    + dispense(now)
    + cancel(reason, note, now)
  }
  class "处方明细 PrescriptionItem" as Item {
    - id : Long
    - drugId : Long
    - drugNameSnapshot : String
    - drugSpecSnapshot : String
    - unitPriceSnapshot : BigDecimal
    - quantity : Integer
    - usageDesc : String
    - days : Integer
    + subtotal() : BigDecimal
  }
  class "药品 Drug" as Drug {
    - id : Long
    - name : String
    - spec : String
    - unit : String
    - price : BigDecimal
    - isPrescription : boolean
    - status : DrugStatus
    + isEnabled() : boolean
  }
  class "审方记录 ReviewRecord" as Review {
    - id : Long
    - prescriptionId : Long
    - reviewerId : Long
    - reviewResult : ReviewResult
    - reason : String
    - reviewedAt : LocalDateTime
  }
  class "审计日志 AuditLog" as Audit {
    - id : Long
    - actorId : Long
    - actorRole : Role
    - action : String
    - targetType : String
    - targetId : Long
    - result : String
    - traceId : String
    - createdAt : LocalDateTime
  }
}

User "1" -- "0..1" Doctor
Department "1" -- "0..*" Doctor
User "1" -- "0..*" Order : 患者下单
Doctor "1" -- "0..*" Order : 接诊
Order "1" -- "0..*" Message
Order "1" -- "0..*" Prescription
Prescription "1" -- "1..*" Item
Drug "1" -- "0..*" Item : 快照来源
Prescription "1" -- "0..*" Review
User "1" -- "0..*" Review : 审核人
User "1" -- "0..*" Audit : 操作人

note bottom of Prescription
  处方状态：DRAFT / PENDING_REVIEW / REJECTED /
  PENDING_DISPENSING / DISPENSED / CANCELLED；
  迁移入口只有 PrescriptionStateMachine，
  每次迁移带 version 做乐观锁。
end note

note bottom of Order
  订单状态：PENDING_PAYMENT → PENDING_ACCEPT →
  IN_CONSULTATION → COMPLETED；
  拒诊、未支付超时进入 CANCELLED。
  prescriptionReady 由处方流转事件更新，
  用于结束问诊前的「已有处方」判断。
end note

@enduml
